Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:59:32 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] chore(release): align workspace version 0.2.1 and harden
 release truth (V1)

- Update package.json, apps/remote, packages/{ui,client,i18n,crypto},
  build.gradle (versionName 0.2.1, versionCode 201), docker/compose.yml to 0.2.1
- Add scripts/check-versions.mjs with --expect, --set, --self-test and root script
- Add ARG WARSHA_VERSION and org.opencontainers.image.version label in Dockerfile
- Always build apps/remote before sync in apps/mobile/android/app/build.gradle
- Add *.jks, *.keystore, *.p12, keystore.properties to root .gitignore
- Check tag version matches check-versions and scope permissions in release.yml
- Fix stale comment in desktop-bundle.yml:18 regarding createUpdaterArtifacts
- Remove 840513 contradiction and stale build date in apps/mobile/README.md
- Update docs/DAEMON.md with all 14 stages and real provider RPC handlers
